    <div class="reveal mb-10 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-800 text-navy-800">The GMAT Focus Edition: <span class="text-accent-600">Overview</span></h2>
      <p class="text-navy-600 text-base leading-relaxed max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-4">The GMAT Focus Edition is the modern, streamlined version of the premier business school entrance exam. Re-engineered for efficiency, the exam is only 2 hours and 15 minutes long and allows you to complete the sections in any order you choose.</p>
      <p class="text-navy-800 text-base font-semibold max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-4">The test consists of three 45-minute sections that contribute equally to your Total Score (Scale: 205–805):</p>
